BT
/F1 10.5 Tf
12.0749999999999993 TL
0.157 0.188 0.204 rg
51.0236220472441033 521.5750393700786844 Td
(We already use digital systems for customer records, memberships, and visits, so the priority would be) Tj
T* (improving existing capabilities rather than introducing a separate system that duplicates records.) Tj
ET
