(A useful solution or enhancement would need to:) Tj
T* (- Keep customer and vehicle records accurate.) Tj
T* (- Track membership validity, visits, and renewals.) Tj
T* (- Help staff identify possible duplicate records for review.) Tj
T* (- Support complaint tracking and follow-up.) Tj
T* (- Restrict access according to staff responsibilities.) Tj
T* (- Maintain a history of important record changes.) Tj
T* (- Provide useful reports without unnecessarily exposing personal data.) Tj
T* (- Be simple for staff to use during busy periods.) Tj
